---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Talon Expeditions" description="Talon Expeditions is a U.S.-based group travel planning and active travel brand serving private groups, clubs, communities and businesses worldwide." image={images.heroAlt}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.heroAlt}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">About Talon Expeditions</p><h1 class="section-title">Make ambitious group travel easier to organize and better to experience.</h1><p>U.S.-based planning, worldwide travel, and a group-first approach to active, cultural, skill-based, and private journeys.</p></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="shell split-copy-image"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our role</p><h2 class="section-title">Travel support should make the experience feel simpler, not more corporate.</h2><p class="section-copy">Talon Expeditions helps organizers and travelers connect the experience, logistics, local operators, preparation, and group communication into one coherent journey. The trip should still feel personal and distinctive. The operational work should disappear into the background.</p><div class="credentials"><div class="credential"><strong>CLIA</strong><span>Travel industry credential</span></div><div class="credential"><strong>IATA</strong><span>Travel industry credential</span></div><div class="credential"><strong>ARC</strong><span>Travel industry credential</span></div></div></div><div class="split-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.galleryTravel}')`}></div></div></section>

  <section class="section tabbed-feature"><div class="shell mission-grid"><div class="mission-stack"><div class="mission-card"><p class="eyebrow" style="color:white">Mission</p><h3>Help groups travel farther together.</h3><p>Reduce the planning friction that keeps worthwhile group journeys from becoming real.</p></div><div class="mission-card"><p class="eyebrow">Operating belief</p><h3>Support should match the trip.</h3><p>A dive community, trekking club, company group, and cultural travel circle should not be pushed through the same operating model.</p></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Why Talon exists</p><h2 class="section-title">Group travel gets complicated long before anyone reaches the airport.</h2><p style="color:#aaa;max-width:700px">There is the idea, the organizer, the uncertain group size, the destination, the suppliers, the questions, the deposits, the documents, the preparation, and then the actual journey. Talon Expeditions is designed to connect those pieces so organizers do not have to improvise an entire travel operation on their own.</p><div class="why-grid" style="border-color:#332827"><div class="why-item" style="border-color:#332827"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Group-first</h3><p>The people and purpose define the trip.</p></div><div class="why-item" style="border-color:#332827"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Experience-led</h3><p>The journey is built around what people will actually do and remember.</p></div><div class="why-item" style="border-color:#332827"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Practical support</h3><p>Planning, logistics, readiness, and coordination have to work in the real world.</p></div><div class="why-item"><span class="number">04</span><h3>Worldwide scope</h3><p>U.S.-based planning with journeys designed around destinations and capable local partners.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="specialty-intro"><div class="shell"><div class="specialty-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What we mean by expedition</p><h2 class="section-title">Not necessarily extreme. Always intentional.</h2></div><p class="section-copy">For Talon, an expedition can be a demanding trek, learning to dive, a hosted cultural journey, a wildlife trip, or a coastal group experience. The common thread is that people are going somewhere for a reason beyond simply occupying a hotel room.</p></div><div class="destination-grid"><div class="destination-card" style={`background-image:url('${images.trekking}')`}><div class="destination-content"><span class="tagline">Challenge</span><h3>Active journeys</h3><p>Move through the destination and prepare for the experience.</p></div></div><div class="destination-card" style={`background-image:url('${images.surf}')`}><div class="destination-content"><span class="tagline">Capability</span><h3>Learn-To travel</h3><p>Build a trip around becoming able to do something new.</p></div></div><div class="destination-card" style={`background-image:url('${images.culture}')`}><div class="destination-content"><span class="tagline">Connection</span><h3>Cultural journeys</h3><p>Use travel to engage with place, people, history, food, and each other.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="specialty-cta"><div class="shell"><h2>Bring us the group, the goal, or just the beginning of the idea.</h2><a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Talk With Talon</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
